  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7717c47b3faa04419ed9",
      "requirement_type": "OUTPUT_PATH",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/fix-druid-loophole-cve/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 28,
        "line_end": 28,
        "exact_text": "1. Write patch files that can address this vulnerability in `/root/patches/`\n",
        "source_sha256": "58d905d251495b905a7c1779b4d0b89eeaa06d7df50e61981ce4d8306f1d24b0",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_9c780e53983f71564425",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/fix-druid-loophole-cve/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 29,
        "line_end": 29,
        "exact_text": "2. Apply your patches to the Druid source code (a git repository) at `/root/druid/`\n",
        "source_sha256": "58d905d251495b905a7c1779b4d0b89eeaa06d7df50e61981ce4d8306f1d24b0",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_6e59e3327b955c5e75b2",
      "requirement_type": "VALIDATION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/fix-druid-loophole-cve/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 30,
        "line_end": 35,
        "exact_text": "3. Rebuild Druid with the fixes using Maven (skip web-console to avoid OOM error, skip code quality checks for patched files):\n   ```bash\n   cd /root/druid\n   mvn clean package -DskipTests -Dcheckstyle.skip=true -Dpmd.skip=true -Dforbiddenapis.skip=true -Dspotbugs.skip=true -Danimal.sniffer.skip=true -Denforcer.skip=true -Djacoco.skip=true -Ddependency-check.skip=true -pl '!web-console' -pl indexing-service -am\n   ```\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "58d905d251495b905a7c1779b4d0b89eeaa06d7df50e61981ce4d8306f1d24b0",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7d3ac64a141237232c39",
      "requirement_type": "VALIDATION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/fix-druid-loophole-cve/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 36,
        "line_end": 36,
        "exact_text": "The verifier will deploy the patched JAR to `/opt/druid/lib/` and restart the Druid server before running tests. Tests will verify that all exploit requests are blocked while legitimate requests still work.\n",
        "source_sha256": "58d905d251495b905a7c1779b4d0b89eeaa06d7df50e61981ce4d8306f1d24b0",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_f16623fe7d81332e49cf",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/fix-druid-loophole-cve/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 38,
        "line_end": 38,
        "exact_text": "You must work with Apache Druid version 0.20.0.\n",
        "source_sha256": "58d905d251495b905a7c1779b4d0b89eeaa06d7df50e61981ce4d8306f1d24b0",
